#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1339 expect=violation domain=LB
#note "EPOCH column is not present in the dataset at all: the bare empty(EPOCH) leaf is TRUE on every row (absent = all-missing, EC-43) and the rule fires on every row with a populated collection date. Row 1: LBDTC populated -> fires. Row 2: LBDTC empty -> clean. EPOCH is in the rule's OV but absent here - the engine has no value to attach; pin by row + LBSEQ only."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 LBSEQ=1
dataset LB class=FINDINGS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col LBSEQ    type=Num
col LBTESTCD type=Char
col LBDTC    type=Char
---
S1 | LB | 001 | 1 | GLUC | 2020-06-01
S1 | LB | 001 | 2 | ALB  |
